@node Integration Tests
@chapter Integration Tests

@cindex integration tests
@cindex workflow tests

This chapter describes the integration tests.

@section Org to LaTeX Workflow

@deffn Test list-manager-integration-test-org-to-latex-workflow
Tests the complete workflow of converting plain text to org list,
then to checkboxes, then back to dash list.

Steps:
@enumerate
@item
Start with plain lines.

@item
Convert to org list with @code{list-manager-lines-in-region-to-org-list}.

@item
Convert to checkboxes with
@code{list-manager-org-convert-list-in-region-to-checkboxes}.

@item
Convert back to dash list with
@code{list-manager-convert-org-checklist-to-dash-list}.
@end enumerate
@end deffn

@section LaTeX Formatting Recovery Workflow

@deffn Test list-manager-integration-test-latex-formatting-recovery
Tests recovering LaTeX formatting stripped by 750words.

Steps:
@enumerate
@item
Start with stripped LaTeX (missing backslashes, no newlines).

@item
Add backslashes with @code{list-manager-add-backslashes}.

@item
Restore newlines with @code{list-manager-restore-newlines}.
@end enumerate
@end deffn

@section Extract and Cut Workflow

@deffn Test list-manager-integration-test-extract-and-cut-workflow
Tests extracting unchecked items, verifying them, then cutting them.

Steps:
@enumerate
@item
Extract unchecked items to kill ring (non-destructive).

@item
Verify the extracted items.

@item
Cut the unchecked items (removes from buffer).

@item
Verify original buffer contains only checked items.
@end enumerate
@end deffn

@section Mixed List Types

@deffn Test list-manager-integration-test-mixed-list-types
Tests that different list markers (@code{-}, @code{*}, @code{+})
produce consistent LaTeX output.
@end deffn

